From: AF9 <af9@localhost>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 12:32:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fusion reactors: GT's own ring structure again for every
 tier, energy hatches still optional (7.5.3-af9.16)

- GTMultiMachines: the pattern and preview are GT's 15 x 15 ring again (FusionStructure and its round 19-block ring are gone).
  Energy hatches stay optional in the structure (GT requires one); no minimum.
- FusionRingRender: GT's ring size again.
- The magnetic field of 0015 is untouched.
